/* Metallic paint, per vertex on the CPU (the GE has no programmable
 * shading). Intensity = dark ambient + key diffuse + view-facing "flop".
 * Each channel follows its own curve, so red falls off fastest in shadow
 * and rises fastest in highlights: dark pure green on the flanks, yellow
 * lime where the panel faces the viewer, as on the original showroom car.
 * Colours are halved here and doubled by GU_FRAGMENT_2X, so highlights can
 * exceed the base paint colour. */
