/* The material for this frame's light (paint_frame, once before shade_paint's
 * vertices): per channel the diffuse d0 + dd N.V and the highlight's colour
 * s0 + ds N.V (its gain, the light and 255 in), N.H^e as a table (powf per
 * vertex cost the PSP's game thread 10 ms in the 4101 sprint). */
