/* A building's side the eye may not look through even with ground on both
 * sides of it (the game's walls rise to 3000 m; world_wall_high): its strip
 * met by the step from a to b, in b's cell or a's (the line's 0.5 m steps
 * passed over a strip a few centimetres thick). */
