/* "%.Nf" in integers: newlib's printf turns a float into a double and runs
 * _dtoa_r on it in software, ~0.15 ms a number on a PSP-3000 (the frame's
 * HUD and the lines at the top of the screen printed a dozen). The same
 * text: v = m x 2^(e-150) exactly, times 10^dec rounded half to even, as
 * printf rounds the exact value ("-0.00" kept; checked against printf on
 * two million values); plus: a "+" before what is not negative. */
