/* After a save's give-back of the volatile block (vol_dialog): the city's
 * parts that lived in it, the car's street among them, loaded again before
 * the game goes on, the save's own pause a little longer. Without it the
 * street came back as holes round the car for 6-8 frames after every save
 * (script 10, the PSP-1000's: its 15 near-hole frames, all three after a
 * race's save). Only what the view needs now (world_settle_shown). */
